From 045e15a6fff996d70f513d0a1c7448b3473458e3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sunrisepeak <speakshen@163.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 11:35:02 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Bound worker output payloads and captured request inputs
 before writes

Compiler output budgets cover reduced BMI, implicit cache, global index and configured output backends. Captured inputs are checked before snapshot payload writes. Resource-ceiling requests use protocol version 2 so older workers cannot ignore the bound. These optional limits do not claim aggregate cache or filesystem quota enforcement.
